    "You'll have enough later today, or subscribe to make it now." : {
      "comment" : "Under the title of a notice on a chapter's mind map: making the map writes its lessons first, and the free learner doesn't have enough free lessons left for all of them yet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Später heute hast du genug. Mit einem Abo kannst du sie schon jetzt erstellen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tendrás suficientes más tarde hoy, o puedes suscribirte para crearlo ahora."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu en auras assez plus tard aujourd’hui. Pour la créer maintenant, abonne-toi."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ne avrai abbastanza in giornata, oppure abbonati per crearla subito."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日中には無料で作成できるようになります。サブスクリプションに登録すれば、今すぐ作成できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오늘 중에 필요한 만큼 무료 레슨을 이용할 수 있어요. 구독하면 지금 만들 수 있어요."
          }
